id":"8c2b9d1a-db0e-11ef-afc6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"襄陵縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄陵县","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d1b-db0e-11ef-b07d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"襄陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄陵","place_note":"河南睢县","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d1c-db0e-11ef-b928-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉州","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋州","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d1d-db0e-11ef-8d3b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"臨汾縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"临汾县","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d1e-db0e-11ef-9595-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"后魏","start_index":75,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d1f-db0e-11ef-bc73-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"禽昌縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"禽昌县","start_index":78,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d20-db0e-11ef-953f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":82,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d21-db0e-11ef-9f25-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"襄陵縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄陵县","start_index":89,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d22-db0e-11ef-bbd8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"史記正義曰：襄陵故城，在兗州鄒縣。余按魏境時不至於鄒。班志，河東有襄陵縣。師古曰：晉襄公之陵，因以名縣。括地志：襄陵在晉州臨汾縣東南三十五里。宋白曰：後魏爲禽昌縣；隋大業二年改爲襄陵縣，以趙襄子、晉襄公俱陵於是邑也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"史记正义曰：襄陵故城，在兖州邹县。余按魏境时不至于邹。班志，河东有襄陵县。师古曰：晋襄公之陵，因以名县。括地志：襄陵在晋州临汾县东南三十五里。宋白曰：后魏为禽昌县；隋大业二年改为襄陵县，以赵襄子、晋襄公俱陵于是邑也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d0e-db0e-11ef-b986-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"襄陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄陵","place_note":"河南睢县","resolved_place_entity_id":3417,"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d27-db0e-11ef-aeb9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/六、归德府（卷五十）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"楚怀王六年，柱国昭阳将兵攻魏，破之于襄陵，得八邑。秦置襄...","context_before":"...三十五年，齐伐取我襄陵。《齐世家》：威王使田忌伐魏襄陵。","source_end_index":130,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"f3f7129b-a5e7-5976-abc3-916d9b6eaedf","source_start_index":115,"source_text":"又魏惠王十九年，诸侯围我襄陵。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/六、归德府（卷五十）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"2諸侯圍魏襄陵。","content_fanyi":"诸侯出兵围攻魏国的襄陵。","content_jianti_auto":"2诸侯围魏襄陵。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":146,"number":2,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二 (周紀二) / 顯王 / 十七年 / 第 2 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d0d-db0e-11ef-b8ba-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-352},"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d0d-db0e-11ef-b8ba-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"襄陵","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"9f688b84-db0e-11ef-8b3e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"晉襄公","people_name_jianti_auto":"晋襄公","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"9f688b85-db0e-11ef-b836-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"襄陵縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄陵县","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"9f688b86-db0e-11ef-9e50-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"9f688b87-db0e-11ef-85be-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河東郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"河东郡","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"9f688b88-db0e-11ef-b1f6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"9f688b89-db0e-11ef-b03b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"平陽郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"平阳郡","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"9f688b8a-db0e-11ef-9860-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"襄陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄陵","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"9f688b8b-db0e-11ef-a90a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"平陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"平阳","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"9f688b8c-db0e-11ef-8724-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"帥，讀曰率。襄陵縣，漢屬河東郡，晉屬平陽郡。師古曰：晉襄公之陵，因以名縣。據水經註，襄陵在平陽東南。","note_content_jianti_auto":"帅，读曰率。襄陵县，汉属河东郡，晋属平阳郡。师古曰：晋襄公之陵，因以名县。据水经注，襄陵在平阳东南。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"9f688b83-db0e-11ef-9532-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"襄陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄陵","resolved_place_entity_id":3417,"start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"9f688b93-db0e-11ef-8bba-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、平阳府（卷四十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"永和十二年，姚襄为桓温所败，自洛阳奔平阳，进据襄陵。太元...","context_before":"...东南三十五里，是也。《晋·地道记》曰：晋武公自曲沃徙此。","source_end_index":129,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"af0cd08a-ca7f-5d40-ab76-da8b5e59205b","source_start_index":107,"source_text":"晋大兴初，平阳乱，石勒西击靳准，据襄陵北原。"},{"context_after":"恐误]。","context_before":"...○赤壁，在县西一里，亦曰赤壁城，亦壁水经其下。《志》云：","source_end_index":87,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"37b71058-8a38-53e9-b33d-495bfc7844d4","source_start_index":65,"source_text":"晋大兴初，刘曜自长安讨靳准军，至赤壁，即此。"},{"context_after":"《水经注》：皮氏县西北有赤石川，盖置壁垒于此，因名]。","context_before":"...封陵，冀谓冀亭矣。○赤壁，在县北，刘渊据平阳时置戍处也。","source_end_index":154,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"0fbd42da-2bbf-5dc8-8e51-6da966fc609b","source_start_index":126,"source_text":"晋太兴初，靳准尽诛刘氏，刘曜闻乱，自长安赴之，军于赤壁。"}],"path":"山西方舆纪要/二、平阳府（卷四十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"相國曜聞亂，自長安赴之。石勒帥精銳五萬以討準，據襄陵北原。準數挑戰，勒堅壁以挫之。","content_fanyi":"相国刘曜听说国内发生动乱，从长安赶来救援。石勒率领五万精兵讨伐靳准，占据襄陵北面的平原。靳准多次挑战，石勒坚守营垒不出，以此消磨对方锐气。","content_jianti_auto":"相国曜闻乱，自长安赴之。石勒帅精锐五万以讨准，据襄陵北原。准数挑战，勒坚壁以挫之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":7761,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第九十 (晉紀十二) / 中宗元皇帝上 / 太興元年 / 第 29 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":28,"ton