dex":22,"tongjian_id":"a1febdfc-db0e-11ef-9594-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、平阳府（卷四十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"太元十一年，苻丕自晋阳南屯平阳，与慕容永战于襄陵，大败。...","context_before":"...自曲沃徙此。晋大兴初，平阳乱，石勒西击靳准，据襄陵北原。","source_end_index":155,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"af0cd08a-ca7f-5d40-ab76-da8b5e59205b","source_start_index":129,"source_text":"永和十二年，姚襄为桓温所败，自洛阳奔平阳，进据襄陵。"},{"context_after":"城周五里，高二丈。杜佑曰：姚襄城西临黄河，控带龙门，实为...","context_before":"姚襄城[州西五十二里。","source_end_index":30,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"e90569bd-98eb-59dd-81ce-b027f6e31adf","source_start_index":11,"source_text":"襄为桓温所败，走平阳时所筑，后人因名。"}],"path":"山西方舆纪要/二、平阳府（卷四十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"姚襄奔平陽，秦幷州刺史尹赤復以衆降襄，襄遂據襄陵。秦大將軍張平擊之，襄爲平所敗，乃與平約爲兄弟，各罷兵。","content_fanyi":"姚襄奔逃到平阳，前秦并州刺史尹赤又率领部众归降姚襄，姚襄便占据了襄陵。前秦大将军张平出兵攻击他，姚襄被张平击败，就与张平约定结为兄弟，双方各自罢兵停战。","content_jianti_auto":"姚襄奔平阳，秦幷州刺史尹赤复以众降襄，襄遂据襄陵。秦大将军张平击之，襄为平所败，乃与平约为兄弟，各罢兵。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":8713,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百 (晉紀二十二) / 孝宗穆皇帝中之下 / 十二年 / 第 19 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"a1fe82ba-db0e-11ef-97c2-a0d3651f611f","year_int":356},"tongjian_id":"a1fe82ba-db0e-11ef-97c2-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":3},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"襄陵","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"襄陵縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄陵县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a38227a5-db0e-11ef-bd79-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"a38227a6-db0e-11ef-931b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河東郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"河东郡","start_index":6,"tongjian_